    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Relative to the DID predictor considered by Chernozhukov, Wüthrich, and Zhu (2021), our predictor has a key advantage: it does not imply parallel trends. Their DID specification predicts the untreated potential outcome of the treated group using",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                147,
                1084,
                228
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 0,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    137.0,
                    147.0
                ],
                [
                    1084.0,
                    147.0
                ],
                [
                    1084.0,
                    228.0
                ],
                [
                    137.0,
                    228.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "display_formula",
            "block_content": " $$ \\widehat{Y}_{2,t}(0)=\\widehat{\\mu}+Y_{1,t}, $$ ",
            "block_bbox": [
                521,
                246,
                701,
                278
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    521.0,
                    246.0
                ],
                [
                    701.0,
                    246.0
                ],
                [
                    701.0,
                    278.0
                ],
                [
                    521.0,
                    278.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "where  $ \\hat{\\mu} $ estimates a time-invariant difference between the two groups. Thus, asymptotically, the prediction error is simply the untreated outcome gap after removing a constant. If this prediction error has a stable distribution over time and is integrable, then",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                299,
                1083,
                380
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    135.0,
                    299.0
                ],
                [
                    1083.0,
                    299.0
                ],
                [
                    1083.0,
                    380.0
                ],
                [
                    135.0,
                    380.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "display_formula",
            "block_content": " $$ \\mathbb{E}[Y_{2,t}(0)-Y_{1,t}(0)] $$ ",
            "block_bbox": [
                517,
                400,
                703,
                430
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    517.0,
                    400.0
                ],
                [
                    703.0,
                    400.0
                ],
                [
                    703.0,
                    430.0
                ],
                [
                    517.0,
                    430.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "must be constant over time. First-differencing this equality yields",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                452,
                775,
                477
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    137.0,
                    452.0
                ],
                [
                    775.0,
                    452.0
                ],
                [
                    775.0,
                    477.0
                ],
                [
                    137.0,
                    477.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "display_formula",
            "block_content": " $$ \\mathbb{E}[Y_{2,t}(0)-Y_{2,t-1}(0)-(Y_{1,t}(0)-Y_{1,t-1}(0))]=0, $$ ",
            "block_bbox": [
                377,
                498,
                844,
                528
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    377.0,
                    498.0
                ],
                [
                    844.0,
                    498.0
                ],
                [
                    844.0,
                    528.0
                ],
                [
                    377.0,
                    528.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "which is precisely the parallel-trends assumption.",
            "block_bbox": [
                138,
                549,
                617,
                575
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    138.0,
                    549.0
                ],
                [
                    617.0,
                    549.0
                ],
                [
                    617.0,
                    575.0
                ],
                [
                    138.0,
                    575.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Our predictor instead yields the prediction error",
            "block_bbox": [
                172,
                588,
                644,
                615
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    172.0,
                    588.0
                ],
                [
                    644.0,
                    588.0
                ],
                [
                    644.0,
                    615.0
                ],
                [
                    172.0,
                    615.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "display_formula",
            "block_content": " $$ Y_{2,t}(0)-\\widehat{Y}_{2,t}(0)=Y_{2,t}(0)-Y_{2,t-1}(0)-\\left(Y_{1,t}(0)-Y_{1,t-1}(0)\\right), $$ ",
            "block_bbox": [
                319,
                634,
                901,
                666
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    319.0,
                    634.0
                ],
                [
                    901.0,
                    634.0
                ],
                [
                    901.0,
                    666.0
                ],
                [
                    319.0,
                    666.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "namely the untreated differential trend between the two groups. Stability of the distribution of this prediction error only requires, in particular, that",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                686,
                1083,
                741
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    686.0
                ],
                [
                    1083.0,
                    686.0
                ],
                [
                    1083.0,
                    741.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    741.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "display_formula",
            "block_content": " $$ \\mathbb{E}[Y_{2,t}(0)-Y_{2,t-1}(0)-(Y_{1,t}(0)-Y_{1,t-1}(0))] $$ ",
            "block_bbox": [
                399,
                761,
                821,
                791
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    399.0,
